# Security headers (CSP) and cache rules for this site on Cloudflare. Edit here.
# Moved from vercel.json on 22 Nov 2026 (Vercel is retired). Syntax: https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/headers/
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self'
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()

# Ops Room preview framing (27 Nov 2026): the Ops Room shows this page in its preview frame.
# Same CSP as above plus https://ops.dimau-fintech.com in frame-ancestors, on these exact entry pages only.
# Replaces the dimau-link-rewrite Worker, which did this until it was retired. Keep in step with the CSP above.
# The home page rule names the full address: Cloudflare applies rules sorted by their text, and a bare "/" would run before "/*" (two CSPs).
https://dimauventures.com/
  ! Content-Security-Policy
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self' https://ops.dimau-fintech.com
